    "created_at": "2016-08-12T14:17:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-12T14:17:57Z",
    "body": "There appears to be some differences that involve the `name` attribute still in Blink, just not the one about propagation. Namely, `object` is a form-associated element where `embed` is not, but that's in the spec:\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-embed-element\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-object-element\n\nI'm sure there are more quirky things hiding here, but I'll prepare a PR to drop the bit in question at least.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
