    "created_at": "2016-08-12T14:32:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-12T14:32:59Z",
    "body": "I went and found the commit where this was added: 0a2ab224ae351707d3497cbd770a83e84f81e846\n\nHere's a test of that \"allow <a target> to load stuff in them\" bit:\nhttps://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4374\n\nIn Chrome, Edge and Firefox, \"open in iframe\" works but \"open in object\" just opens a new tab. So this thing didn't become reality, time to drop.\n",
